MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Layout-stable prepareFrame packs copy the previous dense fence snapshot and
rewrite TRANSFORM-dirty rows in place, reusing the buffer's entityId→row Map.
Membership/layoutVersion churn still full-rebuilds. Quiet 400/4 dirty ~4.76×;
oracle matches forceFull. Soft-GPU fps not claimed.
